1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"thinking.haus","children":[["$","b","t-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"t"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b",".-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"."}],["$","b","h-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-12",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":12},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"its-dangerous-to-go-alone-take-this","data-content-title":"It’s dangerous to go alone! Take this.","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"It’s dangerous to go alone! Take this."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"September 11, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minute read"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Leave home with basic supplies. Notice something interesting and walk toward it, allowing another point of interest to supersede the first. Talk to people. Accept dead ends. Eventually, return home.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Leave home with basic supplies. Notice something interesting and walk toward it, allowing another point of interest to supersede the first. Talk to people. Accept dead ends. Eventually, return home."]}],["$","p","1-It sounds trivial written out, but there is a real [change in attention](/look-at-this) hidden inside it. Instead of treating the landscape as empty space separating me from destinations, I start treating it as a *field of possible interactions*.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["It sounds trivial written out, but there is a real ",["$","a","1",{"href":"/look-at-this","children":["change in attention"]}]," hidden inside it. Instead of treating the landscape as empty space separating me from destinations, I start treating it as a ",["$","em","3",{"children":["field of possible interactions"]}],"."]}],["$","p","2-The [adventure-game metaphor](https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/best-adventure-games) helps because it changes what counts as significant. A strange staircase becomes a path. A shop becomes an encounter. A distant structure becomes something worth moving toward, at least until something else catches my attention. A dead end isn’t wasted time; it is *explored territory*. The whole thing gives me [permission to be inefficient](/what-happens-next).",{"className":"$undefined","children":["The ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/best-adventure-games","rel":"noreferrer","children":["adventure-game metaphor"]}]," helps because it changes what counts as significant. A strange staircase becomes a path. A shop becomes an encounter. A distant structure becomes something worth moving toward, at least until something else catches my attention. A dead end isn’t wasted time; it is ","$Lf",". The whole thing gives me ","$L10","."]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"],null,"$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16"]}]]}]]}]
